Third-party code

* diffusion_policy/ is adapted from Diffusion Policy
  (https://github.com/real-stanford/diffusion_policy, MIT License,
  Copyright (c) 2023 Columbia Artificial Intelligence and Robotics Lab).
* The world-model guidance in fwm/planner.py and the world-model training in
  dyn_model/ are adapted from Latent Policy Barrier
  (https://project-latentpolicybarrier.github.io/) and DINO-WM
  (https://github.com/gaoyuezhou/dino_wm, MIT License,
  Copyright (c) 2024 Gaoyue Zhou).
* dyn_model/models/vit.py is adapted from vit-pytorch
  (https://github.com/lucidrains/vit-pytorch, MIT License,
  Copyright (c) 2020 Phil Wang).
* diffusion_policy/env/robomimic/xml_files/ contains MJCF task models from
  robosuite (https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite, MIT License).
